# Field Service Mobile LWCs

Full guide: `.cursor/skills/fsl-mobile-lwc/SKILL.md`.

## DO NOT

- Use `lightning-file-upload`; use a file input and Apex upload (`rlmRtkPhotoCapture`)
- Use relative `/sfc/` file URLs or `filePreview` navigation; use absolute `VersionDataUrl`
  and Apex-served page images (`rlmFileViewer`)
- Use the browser Speech Recognition API; it doesn't work in the app
- Load data only in `connectedCallback`; quick actions can set `recordId` later
- Add the action only to a flexipage; the app reads the page layout's action list

## Remember

- `lightning__RecordAction` + `ScreenAction`, close with `CloseActionScreenEvent`
- The user needs `RLM_FSL_Mobile_Extensions` (assigned directly, not via a group)
- Custom actions need a connection; log out and back in to the app after deploying
